---
import { CATEGORIES, SITE } from '../lib/site';

const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="mt-24 overflow-hidden bg-ink text-paper sm:mt-32">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="grid gap-12 border-b border-white/10 py-14 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-8 lg:py-20">
      <div class="lg:col-span-5">
        <a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-3" aria-label={`${SITE.name} 首页`}>
          <span class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center border border-white/20 font-serif text-xl">
            衡
          </span>
          <span>
            <span class="block font-serif text-lg tracking-[0.08em]">{SITE.name}</span>
            <span class="mt-0.5 block font-mono text-[0.52rem] tracking-[0.18em] text-paper/50">
              {SITE.english}
            </span>
          </span>
        </a>
        <p class="mt-7 max-w-sm font-serif text-2xl leading-snug text-paper/90">
          在噪声之外，<br />建立自己的资产坐标。
        </p>
        <p class="mt-5 max-w-sm text-xs leading-6 text-paper/55">
          关注资产配置、行业研究与组合纪律。用可验证的框架，替代对短期预测的依赖。
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-2">
        <p class="rule-label text-paper/40">Explore</p>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2.5 text-sm text-paper/70">
          <li><a class="transition-colors hover:text-paper" href="/research/">研究档案</a></li>
          <li><a class="transition-colors hover:text-paper" href="/tools/">投资工具</a></li>
          <li><a class="transition-colors hover:text-paper" href="/favorites/">我的收藏</a></li>
          <li><a class="transition-colors hover:text-paper" href="/about/">关于我们</a></li>
          <li><a class="transition-colors hover:text-paper" href="/subscribe/">订阅与联系</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-3">
        <p class="rule-label text-paper/40">Research themes</p>
        <ul class="mt-4 grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-5 gap-y-2.5 text-sm text-paper/70">
          {CATEGORIES.map((category) => (
            <li>
              <a
                class="transition-colors hover:text-paper"
                href={`/research/?category=${encodeURIComponent(category.name)}`}
              >
                {category.name}
              </a>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-2">
        <p class="rule-label text-paper/40">Stay curious</p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-6 text-paper/65">
          不定期分享研究笔记与组合观察。
        </p>
        <a href="/subscribe/" class="mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-paper/40 pb-1 text-xs font-semibold text-paper transition-colors hover:border-paper">
          留下订阅意向
          <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/rss.xml" class="mt-5 flex items-center gap-2 text-[0.68rem] text-paper/45 transition-colors hover:text-paper/80">
          <svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-3.5 w-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round">
            <circle cx="6" cy="18" r="1.6" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"></circle>
            <path d="M5 11a8 8 0 0 1 8 8M5 5a14 14 0 0 1 14 14"></path>
          </svg>
          RSS 订阅
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="py-7">
      <p class="max-w-4xl text-[0.68rem] leading-5 text-paper/38">
        风险提示：本站为纯前端 MVP 演示站点，人物档案、研究内容、联系信息与计算结果均为示例，不构成任何投资建议、收益承诺或产品推介。市场有风险，投资需谨慎。
      </p>
      <div class="mt-5 flex flex-col justify-between gap-3 border-t border-white/10 pt-5 text-[0.65rem] text-paper/35 sm:flex-row sm:items-center">
        <p>© {year} {SITE.name} HENGYUAN RESEARCH. 保留所有权利。</p>
        <p class="font-mono tracking-[0.08em]">STATIC · NO BACKEND · NO TRACKING</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
